cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you cite this guest, cite the SolidCraft engine and libriscv.
title: interactor-solidcraft-guest
abstract: >-
  A godot-sandbox (libriscv) Rust guest that drives the SolidCraft engine.
  It registers the engine's control-channel API as host-callable guest
  functions, builds solids, and halts so the host can call the API.
type: software
authors:
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
license: Apache-2.0
references:
  - type: software
    title: SolidCraft
    url: https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft
    license: MIT or Apache-2.0
  - type: software
    title: libriscv
    url: https://github.com/libriscv/libriscv
    license: BSD-3-Clause
  - type: software
    title: Rust
    url: https://www.rust-lang.org
    license: Apache-2.0
